cff-version: 1.2.0
message: 'If you use The Maze Game or the mazeforge library, please cite it as below.'
title: 'The Maze Game'
abstract: >-
  A fully-featured, open-source maze game with procedurally generated,
  always-solvable mazes, accounts and per-user progress, achievements, global
  leaderboards, and a standalone Python maze generation/solving library
  (mazeforge). Vanilla-JS frontend, MongoDB-backed Express API, and a
  production-grade Python package.
type: software
version: '1.3.0'
date-released: '2026-06-03'
license: MIT
